000091ce  # 0  CRC16 of the header, computed
000091ce  # 1  header CRC16 field (0x15E)
00008000  # 2  ARM9 ROM offset
02000420  # 3  ARM9 entry
02000400  # 4  ARM9 RAM address
000000ac  # 5  ARM9 size
0000002b  # 6  words copied into RAM
aa408dc2  # 7  their checksum (h * 33 + w)
02000400  # 8  payload: RAM address handed over in r0
000000ac  # 9  payload: size in r1
000091ce  # 10 payload: header CRC in r2
02000420  # 11 payload: ADR of its entry
600dcafe  # 12 payload: literal from its RAM pool
d0b02061  # 13 payload: sum of the 8-word table it was loaded with
b0bdea9f  # 14 payload: table word 0 rewritten and read back
0000005a  # 15 payload: done marker
